Chaoxi / 朝夕 1.0.0

Derived from OwnSeek by cwenwensen and its contributors.
Upstream source: https://github.com/cwenwensen/OwnSeek
Retrieved commit prefix: a9a8da9 (2026-09-12)
The upstream Apache License 2.0 is preserved in LICENSE.

Modifications:
- New native Compose companion UI and generated character illustrations.
- Wen Yining and Lu Jingheng role definitions supplied by the user.
- SQLite conversations and editable, user-confirmed long-term memory.
- Android Keystore protection for the local DeepSeek credential.
- Configurable WorkManager proactive messaging and notifications.
- Custom companion generation and local JSON backup/restore.
- Current DeepSeek request contract using thinking.type=disabled.

The upstream API DTOs in app/src/upstream-api are reused by this app.
Original source is retained in app/src/main/java for provenance and is
excluded from the companion source set. The new implementation is in
app/src/companion/java. This is an independent modification, not an
official OwnSeek or DeepSeek distribution.

Character artwork generated with the built-in image generation tool.
